      "portrait": "pilot-serious"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "admiral",
      "text": "Overlord 是强大的敌人，但我相信你能做到。",
      "emotion": "confident",
      "portrait": "admiral-confident"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "pilot",
      "text": "为了联邦，为了银河系，我不会失败。",
      "emotion": "determined",
      "portrait": "pilot-determined"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "admiral",
      "text": "去吧，英雄。愿星辰与你同在。",
      "emotion": "inspiring",
      "portrait": "admiral-inspiring"
    }
